'''Icewing''' is an [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[Icewing Gamepass]] for 2,499 Robux during the [[Christmas Event 2018|2018 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through [[trading]] as the event has since ended. 

== Appearance==
It has a thin, slightly jagged handle with a light blue grip that consists of a gradient of dark blue to cerulean. It has a diamond surrounded by icicles between the blade and handle, along with a bright blue blade made of ice in the shape of a wing, hence its name.  

==Trivia == 
*It was the main target of the [[The Icewing Glitch (2018-2019)|Icewing Glitch]] and the [[The Duping Glitch (2022)|Duping Glitch (2022)]]. It has lost a ton of value due to being heavily targeted.
*Its model derives from the Roblox back accessory [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/2620430430/Frozen-Back-Scythe Frozen Back Scythe], purchasable from the avatar shop for 600 Robux.
*There was a glitch were if you used this knife with the [[Knifeception]] effect will cause both the Icewing and the currently equipped gun to render invisible, however, this has been fixed.
* There was a glitch where if you use this knife with the [[Ghostify]] effect, it will make the knife [[Holly Knife (2018)|Holly]] appear, however, this has been patched.
*This and [[Batwing]] are currently the only shop ancients released in the game.
*Its mesh, published by [[didi1147]], can be found [https://www.roblox.com/library/3183432855/Ice-Wing-Fixed2 here].
* This is one of the few scythes in game, the others being [[Nik's Scythe]], [[Batwing]], [[Elderwood Scythe]], [[Hallowscythe]], [[Reaver]], and [[Gingerscythe|Gingerscythe.]]
*This knife is also disliked for having a bigger hitbox than most knives due to its shape. The only weapon to have a bigger hitbox is the [[Ancient Weapons|Ancient]] variant of [[Gingerscythe|Gingerscythe]].

